---
const year = 2026;
---

<footer style="background-color: #102D46; color: #FFFFFF; padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 40px; margin-top: auto;">
  <div class="max-container">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 48px;">
      
      <!-- Col 1: Brand Info -->
      <div style="max-width: 280px;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <img src="/images/logo-icon.svg" alt="机场智选 LOGO" width="32" height="32" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;" />
          <span style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">机场智选</span>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #10B89A; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          聪明选择，不必多花。
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: #A4B8C7; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          SmartChoice MAX 旗舰版。专注于热门机场品牌资料整理、套餐实际成本分析、真实购买决策与理性消费指南。
