          <li><a href="/billing-guide/" style="color: #A4B8C7; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;" class="footer-link">付款周期选择全攻略</a></li>
          <li><a href="/traffic-guide/" style="color: #A4B8C7; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;" class="footer-link">流量额度选购指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/buying-risks/" style="color: #A4B8C7; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;" class="footer-link">机场购买风险与避坑</a></li>
          <li><a href="/articles/" style="color: #A4B8C7; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;" class="footer-link">精选深度专题文章</a></li>
          <li><a href="/updates/" style="color: #A4B8C7; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;" class="footer-link">套餐与品牌动态追踪</a></li>
