          <li><a href="/about/" style="color: #A4B8C7; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;" class="footer-link">关于机场智选</a></li>
          <li><a href="/methodology/" style="color: #A4B8C7; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;" class="footer-link">数据标准与推荐机制</a></li>
          <li><a href="/disclosure/" style="color: #A4B8C7; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;" class="footer-link">商业推广关系披露</a></li>
